  including focus restoration after an overlay closes; the loading, empty,
  error, and truncated states are covered rather than only the state the work
  was built in; and a screenshot must be taken AND opened, judged for legibility
  at rendered scale, overlap, clipping, spacing, and focus ring containment. The
  section closes the three false claims: a projection test, an unopened
  screenshot, and a successful build are none of them evidence that an interface
  works. docs/developing.md's frontend golden path was rewritten to match and
